<Base title={"Test Instrument Modules (TIMs) | Roos Instruments"}
  description={"Test Instrument Modules (TIMs) provide the building blocks for a configurable automated \n  test system with resource ports designed to integrate seamlessly, creating a flexible instrument architecture. This \n     gives Cassini drop in measurement capability and frequency extension as well as instant multi-site \n     expansion with all the DC, mixed signal, and high frequency pins that an integrated circuit might need."}
  active={["nav-products"]}>
