    <div id="content" class="roosC container tim-specs">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12">
          <p>
            Cassini isn’t just modular instruments, it’s a modular architecture and there’s a difference. Test
            Instrument Modules (TIMs) provide the building blocks for a configurable microwave system with resource
            ports designed to integrate seamlessly, creating a flexible instrument architecture. This gives Cassini drop
            in measurement capability and frequency extension as well as instant multi-site expansion with all the DC,
            mixed signal, and communication pins that an IC might need.
          </p>
          <a href="/pdf/All_TIM_Briefs.zip" title="All TIM Briefs (zip)" class="link"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf"></i>
            Download All TIM
            Briefs (.zip) &raquo;</a> or click on a TIM below to get its Brief.
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr id="source" class="space">
