          <h3>Sources</h3>
          <p>Precision microwave signal delivery. Continuous wave signals from 100 MHz to 20 GHz. Modulated sources from
            10 kHz to 6 GHz carrier with 20 MHz baseband.</p>
          <a href="/core.html#Sourcing">Learn More &raquo;</a>
        </div>
      </div>

