      <hr id="combiner" class="space">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-2">
          <img src="images/mod_comb.png" alt="Combiners Icon">
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-9" style="padding: 0 30px;">
          <h3>Signal Combination</h3>
          <p>These instruments extend the capability of microwave sources by providing signal routing and signal
            conditioning features. Two input sources can be routed out of 4 different outputs for increased port
            efficiency. Built-in step attenuators and amplifications extends the dynamic range of traditional sources
            providing 150dB of adjustable dynamic range. Precision microwave combiners enable two-tone signal delivery
            for high performance intermodulation and linearity test setups.</p>
          <a href="/core.html#Sourcing">Learn More &raquo;</a>
        </div>
      </div>

